---
title: Cannelés
portions: 10
category: Pastry
source: "Bordeaux classic"
---


## Batter ~{-1d} ->&batter

[Mix] In a #mixing bowl{}, combine the @flour{100 g}, the @sugar{200 g}, and the @salt{2 g}. ->&dry ingredients{}

[Heat] In a #saucepan{}, bring the @milk{500 ml}, the @butter{50 g}, and the @vanilla bean{1}(split and scraped) to ^{85°C}. ->&hot milk{}

[Mix] Pour the &hot milk{} over the &dry ingredients{} in one go. Whisk vigorously.

[Add] Add the @egg yolk{4}<@egg{4} and the @rum{50 ml}.

[Rest] Cover with #cling film{} in contact and refrigerate for at least ~_refrigerator{24 h}.

## Molding

[Line] Butter the #cannelé molds{} generously.

[Fill] Fill the molds to 3/4 with the &batter. Bake at ^{180°C} for ~_{50 min}.
